sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Requester
    participant UI as Streamlit app
    participant C as Amazon Cognito
    participant RT as AgentCore Runtime<br/>(Procurement Agent)
    participant M as AgentCore Memory
    participant G as Bedrock Guardrails
    participant LLM as Amazon Nova Lite
    participant GW as AgentCore Gateway<br/>(Policy + interceptor)
    participant T as Tool Lambdas
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant O as AgentCore Observability
    actor A as Approver
    participant API as Approval API<br/>(API Gateway + Lambda)
    participant S3 as S3 purchase-orders

    R->>UI: Sign in
    UI->>C: Authenticate
    C-->>UI: JWT (group = requester)
    R->>UI: "I need 50 laptops by Dec 15"
    UI->>RT: POST /invocations + JWT
    RT->>O: Start trace
    RT->>G: Check input (prompt attack, denied topics)
    G-->>RT: Allowed
    RT->>M: Load session history
    RT->>LLM: Converse, forced extract_request tool
    LLM-->>RT: product, quantity, required date
    RT-->>UI: Extracted fields
    R->>UI: Confirm or edit fields
    UI->>RT: POST /invocations (confirmed request)
    RT->>LLM: Converse with Gateway tool list
    LLM-->>RT: call get_supplier_quotes
    RT->>GW: MCP tools/call + OAuth token (AgentCore Identity)
    GW->>GW: Policy check (Cedar, default deny) and rate limit
    GW->>T: get_supplier_quotes(confirmed product, quantity)
    T->>DB: Query SupplierQuotes
    DB-->>T: Quote rows
    T-->>GW: Valid quotes + excluded rows
    GW-->>RT: Tool result
    RT->>LLM: Tool result
    LLM-->>RT: call compare_quotes
    RT->>GW: MCP tools/call
    GW->>T: compare_quotes(confirmed date, weights)
    T-->>GW: Ranking, recommended supplier, warnings
    GW-->>RT: Tool result
    RT->>LLM: Tool result
    LLM-->>RT: Explanation text
    RT->>G: Check output (PII, grounding)
    G-->>RT: Allowed
    RT->>M: Save session events
    RT->>O: End trace (latency, tokens, tool calls)
    RT-->>UI: Recommendation (ranking from tools, text from model)
    R->>UI: Submit for approval
    UI->>API: POST /cases + requester JWT
    API->>DB: Save case (PENDING_APPROVAL)

    Note over RT,API: The agent has no tool or route to the Approval API.

    A->>UI: Sign in (group = approver)
    UI->>API: GET /cases?status=pending + approver JWT
    API-->>UI: Pending cases
    A->>UI: Approve
    UI->>API: POST /cases/{id}/decision + approver JWT
    API->>API: Check approver group claim, self-approval, quote expiry, one decision only
    API->>DB: Save decision, audit event
    API->>S3: Write PDF purchase order
    API-->>UI: PO number + presigned download URL
    UI-->>A: PO issued, Download PO (PDF)
